Dialogue: 10,0:00:01.66,0:00:02.99,Default,,0,0,0,,No fever.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:04.33,0:00:05.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Normal pulse, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:05.87,0:00:07.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Then don't tell me...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:07.71,0:00:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Did your company go under?!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:09.54,0:00:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It did not.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:10.79,0:00:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you kill some—
Dialogue: 10,0:00:12.04,0:00:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I did not.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:13.55,0:00:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Then why would you do something like that?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:16.34,0:00:18.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean invite you to my house?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:20.05,0:00:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You must have a reason.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:23.51,0:00:24.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I felt like it?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:26.81,0:00:28.27,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Liar!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:27.73,0:00:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,So, you really just want to hang out?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:28.27,0:00:31.81,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,You never do things because you "feel like it"!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:30.14,0:00:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, really.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:31.81,0:00:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Great. I'll go.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:33.44,0:00:35.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. When works for you?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:35.61,0:00:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,How about... Sunday?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:38.36,0:00:39.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:39.57,0:00:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that's settled, time to plan!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:42.16,0:00:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,This has gotten fun.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:44.62,0:00:47.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, how about I bring something to snack on?{some snacks?}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:47.95,0:00:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What would you like?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:49.33,0:00:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes! I'd like something pricey.{expensive?}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:51.58,0:00:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm asking Neiru.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:53.42,0:00:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I'll bring a takoyaki maker.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:56.42,0:00:58.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget that junk for now.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:58.05,0:00:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,"Junk"?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:59.26,0:01:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Just listen.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:00.72,0:01:03.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, does Sunday work for you?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:02.22,0:01:04.05,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Oh, that might be nice!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:03.05,0:01:04.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:04.05,0:01:05.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what about you two?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:06.18,0:01:07.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course it's fine.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:07.85,0:01:09.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't miss it.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:43.78,0:02:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a recording of President Aonuma's dreams.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:47.20,0:02:49.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Using the technology developed here,
Dialogue: 10,0:02:49.87,0:02:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,it is possible to analyze brainwaves \Nand convert the subject's dreams to video.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:53.37,0:02:55.33,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Whoa.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:57.13,0:02:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,They're not dreams, though.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:58.96,0:03:01.17,Default,,0,0,0,,But they're not reality either.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:01.17,0:03:04.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Science is amazing.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:01.88,0:03:06.18,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,The picture is still rough and monochrome,
Dialogue: 10,0:03:04.05,0:03:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Ai, have her record you.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:06.18,0:03:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll get a sexy fantasy out of it.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:06.18,0:03:11.26,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,but with more research, it will \None day be clear and in full color.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:09.30,0:03:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't lump me in with you.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:11.26,0:03:13.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you live at your company.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:14.02,0:03:15.64,Default,,0,0,0,,This feels like a field trip.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:15.98,0:03:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you, anyway, Neiru?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:18.57,0:03:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What an existentialist question.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:20.86,0:03:22.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:22.28,0:03:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you familiar with a group called Plati?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:25.24,0:03:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. I heard only people with really high IQs can join.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:30.41,0:03:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Ms. Neiru is a member of Japan Plati.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:33.79,0:03:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow. I knew you were really smart.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:36.96,0:03:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just good at thinking logically.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:39.42,0:03:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,How modest, ma'am.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:41.46,0:03:44.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I was born via artificial insemination of a member.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:45.13,0:03:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, so that's why you said you never had parents.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:48.80,0:03:52.05,Default,,0,0,0,,For real? They won't tell you who your parents are?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:52.43,0:03:55.63,Default,,0,0,0,,There'd be no point. It was just a pairing.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:56.31,0:03:59.19,Default,,0,0,0,,That puts {\i1}my{\i0} worries in perspective.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:01.32,0:04:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We've reached floor B9.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:05.65,0:04:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,This is our medical floor.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:07.62,0:04:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you a doctor too, Neiru?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:09.66,0:04:11.95,Default,,0,0,0,,No. I'm not in charge of this floor.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:12.62,0:04:14.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just filling in for now.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:14.79,0:04:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, are we there yet?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:18.00,0:04:18.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:18.79,0:04:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:20.13,0:04:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then, excuse me.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:22.17,0:04:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. Thank you.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:23.54,0:04:25.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:25.34,0:04:27.97,Default,,0,0,0,,All right! This is your room, Neiru?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:26.01,0:04:27.97,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:30.55,0:04:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, books galore.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:35.52,0:04:36.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Neiru,
Dialogue: 10,0:04:36.94,0:04:38.31,Default,,0,0,0,,what's this guy's name?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:38.65,0:04:39.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Adam.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:39.89,0:04:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I touch him?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:41.38,0:04:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:41.98,0:04:44.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Clean up all this paper.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:44.57,0:04:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Come here.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:45.94,0:04:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Where should we eat?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:47.65,0:04:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, wait a moment.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:51.62,0:04:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got exams next week.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:53.70,0:04:55.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't studied at all.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:55.95,0:04:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Me, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:57.83,0:04:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You're lucky, Neiru.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:59.96,0:05:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You get to run this huge company.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:03.30,0:05:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like we live in different worlds.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:07.09,0:05:08.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:09.51,0:05:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, Rika, isn't it about time?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:13.59,0:05:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, let's get started!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:20.64,0:05:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Yesterday, Rika and I got worked \Nup talking about fun things to do.{thinking of?}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:25.98,0:05:27.47,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a pretty color.{that's/such}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:28.15,0:05:29.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:29.65,0:05:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Grown-up, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:31.40,0:05:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We thought we could all do our nails and stuff.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:34.28,0:05:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever painted them?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:35.58,0:05:36.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:35.58,0:05:37.20,Default - Momo,,0,0,0,,I'll do Neiru's.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:36.91,0:05:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Show me your hands.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:37.20,0:05:38.08,Default - Momo,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:38.08,0:05:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You have pretty nails.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:38.08,0:05:41.75,Default - Momo,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. I won't screw up!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:39.62,0:05:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Do I really?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:44.92,0:05:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You're good, Momo.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:47.01,0:05:48.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You could go pro.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:48.59,0:05:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:49.88,0:05:53.05,Default,,0,0,0,,But I think I'd like to be a dietitian.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:53.05,0:05:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm thinking of going to school for it.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:55.14,0:05:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow. I'm impressed you're thinking about that stuff.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:58.56,0:06:01.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to go abroad.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:01.39,0:06:03.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't working in English be cool?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:03.73,0:06:06.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Then an international marriage to a hot guy.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:06.15,0:06:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What a surprise.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:07.94,0:06:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder where I want to go.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:10.28,0:06:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on, we're not talking about vacation.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:13.24,0:06:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, but I might want to try living on my own.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:16.24,0:06:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I get that.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:17.62,0:06:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a dream of mine, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:20.12,0:06:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,There. All done.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:23.75,0:06:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,One's a different color.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:26.33,0:06:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,We match.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:32.55,0:06:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,And you, Neiru?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:34.34,0:06:35.93,Default,,0,0,0,,What's your dream?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:35.93,0:06:38.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, you haven't told us yet.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:38.35,0:06:41.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess we're all sharing our dreams now.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:43.35,0:06:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I'll probably stay like this forever.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:46.52,0:06:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:47.36,0:06:49.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, I didn't mean that earlier.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:49.57,0:06:52.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have to run a company your whole life.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:52.11,0:06:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, if you like books, why not become a writer?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:54.74,0:06:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me introduce a friend.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:57.28,0:06:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you to meet her.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:59.28,0:07:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Your friend?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:14.13,0:07:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone's inside.{ugh}
Dialogue: 10,0:07:15.88,0:07:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,She was born at Japan Plati like I was.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:18.80,0:07:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Awano Kotobuki.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:20.10,0:07:21.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Kotobuki.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:21.47,0:07:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Adam is her pet.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:23.60,0:07:24.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Her hair color...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:24.89,0:07:26.21,Default,,0,0,0,,She's albino.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:26.89,0:07:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,She's gorgeous.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:28.69,0:07:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Albinos are said to bring good \Nfortune to those around them.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:32.82,0:07:37.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Kotobuki was always cheerful and optimistic.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:38.03,0:07:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,She'd tell me to "really enjoy myself."
Dialogue: 10,0:07:40.53,0:07:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,"Was"?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:41.74,0:07:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't she just sleeping?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:44.04,0:07:45.87,Default,,0,0,0,,She's in a vegetative state.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:45.87,0:07:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:46.79,0:07:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Kotobuki was a doctor of psychiatry.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:49.50,0:07:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,She was scientifically analyzing the mysteries of life.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:52.75,0:07:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Death, in particular.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:55.46,0:08:00.76,Default,,0,0,0,,She performed near-death experiments, \Nand eventually didn't come back.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:00.76,0:08:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Near-death experiments...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:02.14,0:08:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Scientists try to solve difficult problems. It's in their nature.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:07.02,0:08:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,She was your friend, wasn't she?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:09.44,0:08:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. I met Kotobuki in a dream.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:12.44,0:08:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,A dream?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:13.82,0:08:15.15,Default,,0,0,0,,An Egg dream.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:17.90,0:08:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,He's incredible.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:19.91,0:08:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,He's Pinky.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:21.24,0:08:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he a type of corn snake?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:23.62,0:08:24.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knows?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:26.91,0:08:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been a long time, Neiru.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:29.79,0:08:31.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Kotobuki...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:31.71,0:08:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Is Adam well?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:33.25,0:08:35.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. You look well, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:35.71,0:08:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess. I'm not bored.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:39.35,0:08:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, I'm glad.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:40.76,0:08:43.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I get a chance to say goodbye to you.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:43.51,0:08:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd better thank God.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:45.48,0:08:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not children of God, remember?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:49.23,0:08:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Scientists who can't believe in God are incompetent.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:53.52,0:08:56.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not a scientist at all.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:56.15,0:08:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You know that.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:57.32,0:08:59.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course. Just needling you.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:03.49,0:09:05.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll protect me, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:07.50,0:09:09.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Or do you want me to protect you?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:11.21,0:09:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's nice. What a lovely weapon.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:16.09,0:09:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's really enjoy ourselves.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:19.72,0:09:22.93,Default,,0,0,0,,There you are!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:25.66,0:09:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Pinky!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:30.94,0:09:32.77,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that? It's hilarious!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:33.73,0:09:35.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Faster! Faster!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:35.61,0:09:38.19,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll catch us if we don't hurry.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:38.78,0:09:40.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Kotobuki, why did you die?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:40.99,0:09:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Why couldn't you come back?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:43.41,0:09:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,When adrenaline enters the brain,
Dialogue: 10,0:09:45.24,0:09:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,they say you see a field of flowers \Nto overcome the fear of death.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:49.20,0:09:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to pick one and bring it back to you.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:53.42,0:09:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't funny!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:55.04,0:09:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't forgive any more jokes.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:56.79,0:09:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The me in the world you're in did die.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:59.96,0:10:02.51,Default,,0,0,0,,But that allowed me to experience it.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:02.51,0:10:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I was right, Neiru: Parallel worlds do exist!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:05.97,0:10:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The possibility of worlds that might have been.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:09.06,0:10:11.43,Default,,0,0,0,,It was your favorite genre of fiction.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:12.35,0:10:15.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes! Our parallel selves are alive!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:15.23,0:10:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That's nice, but I can't see you ever again.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:18.86,0:10:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Being satisfied with seeing each other is so commonplace.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:22.40,0:10:25.11,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not some couple that can't handle long-distance.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:25.45,0:10:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't be so philosophical about it yet.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:36.08,0:10:41.09,Default,,0,0,0,,At stage four Thanato, there was a sweet smell like honey.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:41.09,0:10:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I felt like an insect preyed upon by a carnivorous plant.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:44.80,0:10:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The temptation of death?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:46.80,0:10:48.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Not so much "temptation."
Dialogue: 10,0:10:48.85,0:10:50.89,Default,,0,0,0,,More like my mind and body were abducted.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:51.18,0:10:53.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Abducted? By what?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:53.43,0:10:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,By innocent sorrow.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:55.14,0:10:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What chatty guinea pigs you are!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:07.62,0:11:09.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow. That hurt.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:09.91,0:11:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's Pinky?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:11.12,0:11:12.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Back in my pendant.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:12.83,0:11:15.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. He'll regenerate soon.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:15.62,0:11:16.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:16.67,0:11:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't give up.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:18.33,0:11:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what it takes, I'll go to the place where you died
Dialogue: 10,0:11:21.92,0:11:23.09,Default,,0,0,0,,and bring your statue back to—
Dialogue: 10,0:11:23.09,0:11:26.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't envision dying.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:26.13,0:11:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't reach an abstract place.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:29.55,0:11:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll use near-death experiments, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:31.68,0:11:33.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be ridiculous.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:33.43,0:11:35.73,Default,,0,0,0,,If you went to that zone, you'd die, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:35.73,0:11:38.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What would happen to me in reality then?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:40.19,0:11:41.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did you go?!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:42.48,0:11:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You must know.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:43.98,0:11:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The government will come for my body someday.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:46.86,0:11:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let them do that.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:49.53,0:11:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just a container.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:51.20,0:11:53.95,Default,,0,0,0,,But I was attached to it in my own way.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:53.95,0:11:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want adults touching it.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:56.21,0:11:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:57.46,0:12:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you must know what I want you to do.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:01.96,0:12:02.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:02.75,0:12:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop that.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:04.38,0:12:06.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're not that dense.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:17.31,0:12:18.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:18.65,0:12:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you always so selfish?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:22.90,0:12:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,In the end, you left me to deal with everything!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:26.44,0:12:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Won't you praise my original research methods?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:30.82,0:12:33.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't consider other people's feelings at all!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:33.91,0:12:35.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You're used to that.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:35.49,0:12:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It's still not normal to just die!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:38.66,0:12:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't abnormality more fun?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:41.46,0:12:43.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not fun for me!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:44.21,0:12:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at your face.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:46.38,0:12:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine. You made new friends, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:50.22,0:12:51.09,Default,,0,0,0,,How did...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:51.76,0:12:54.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You're softer than you used to be.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:55.14,0:12:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,But they're not like us.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:57.56,0:12:59.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You made connections with people.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:59.73,0:13:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a wonderful thing.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:02.35,0:13:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Treasure them.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:04.32,0:13:06.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You aren't there.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:07.15,0:13:10.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make friends with those girls in another world-line.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:15.29,0:13:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I finally caught you, you cocky brat.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:19.23,0:13:21.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Kotobuki,
Dialogue: 10,0:13:19.54,0:13:20.61,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Ow, ow, ow.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:21.17,0:13:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't be satisfied until I cut open your pretty little chest.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:25.34,0:13:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:26.63,0:13:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Kotobuki,
Dialogue: 10,0:13:28.30,0:13:32.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Doctor Seki! You stole my job \Nas chief of the medical center!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:32.43,0:13:38.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll analyze every micron of your body \Nand return to those glorious days!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:38.85,0:13:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:40.02,0:13:43.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, the guy who was obsessed with my body.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:43.73,0:13:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,So, this is my trauma.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:46.44,0:13:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's true that he's the last person I'd want to dissect me.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:49.78,0:13:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,True.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:53.07,0:13:53.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:18.10,0:14:19.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Fools!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:19.39,0:14:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the world-famous Seki!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:22.02,0:14:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I have numerous doctorates! My \Npapers have been published in Future!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:26.94,0:14:29.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been on the cover of Future.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:29.73,0:14:30.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Me too.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:30.69,0:14:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha! I won't accept it!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:32.49,0:14:34.99,Default,,0,0,0,,If that's true, solve this problem.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:34.99,0:14:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's ultra-difficult, with a zero-percent success rate!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:38.78,0:14:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Find the radius of a circle that \Nintersects points A, B, C, and D.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:44.79,0:14:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Only a genius can solve it.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:46.92,0:14:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to do it.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:48.84,0:14:50.17,Default,,0,0,0,,So will I.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:50.17,0:14:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You little brats could never figure it out!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:53.63,0:14:55.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to blow your mind!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:55.93,0:14:57.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Then answer!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:58.02,0:14:58.85,Default,,0,0,0,,The answer is
Dialogue: 10,0:14:59.35,0:15:01.35,Default,,0,0,0,,there is no such circle!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:01.35,0:15:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? It can't be.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:03.02,0:15:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,These little girls solved a problem \Nnot even I could? In seconds?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:08.77,0:15:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,No need.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:18.49,0:15:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Doctor what's-his-name had pride, if nothing else.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:22.37,0:15:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Pride chicken.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:25.58,0:15:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Was it that funny?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:27.37,0:15:29.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You sounded like a friend of mine.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:32.63,0:15:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Bravo.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:35.05,0:15:36.76,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Take care of the me in reality.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:37.22,0:15:38.39,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:38.39,0:15:41.01,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,What should you do? Say it in words.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:41.01,0:15:41.76,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:42.35,0:15:45.39,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Because you always do what you say you will.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:46.02,0:15:49.18,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,I'll disconnect your life support.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:49.86,0:15:52.09,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Good. Sorry for a lot.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:52.94,0:15:53.73,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,You should be.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:55.24,0:15:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:58.66,0:16:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Kotobuki was in an Egg?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:01.12,0:16:03.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. There can't even be a miracle now.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:03.95,0:16:05.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Kotobuki is dead.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:05.83,0:16:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, you're not even related. You can't just...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:09.80,0:16:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:11.08,0:16:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,But if I delay, the government will come for her.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:14.59,0:16:17.47,Default,,0,0,0,,An albino genius is a valuable sample.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:17.47,0:16:18.51,Default,,0,0,0,,A sample...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:18.51,0:16:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's just an excuse!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:20.30,0:16:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you kill a girl like her for that?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:22.85,0:16:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,She looks alive. Like she's just sleeping.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:27.48,0:16:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,She's already dead.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:29.07,0:16:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a container.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:33.61,0:16:35.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but I can't watch.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:36.11,0:16:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It's different from killing Seeno Evils or Haters {\i1}there{\i0}.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:39.95,0:16:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah! This is for real.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:42.24,0:16:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,That's too much, even if she did ask you.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:45.45,0:16:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you're just going to do it.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:47.87,0:16:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Then just go home.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:49.58,0:16:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't ask you to take a field trip here.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:53.79,0:16:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't say it like that.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:56.00,0:16:57.55,Default,,0,0,0,,We're worried, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:57.55,0:16:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,About what?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:59.05,0:17:00.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, you're our friend.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:00.76,0:17:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,If you do that, you might end up \Nwith trauma, or baggage, or...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:05.08,0:17:06.81,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no problem, then.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:07.22,0:17:11.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't get sentimental about \Nstopping a dead person's respiration.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:15.77,0:17:17.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, is that so?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:17.53,0:17:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Being smart is scary.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:19.24,0:17:23.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm more frightened of others' overheated passions.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:23.78,0:17:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you talking about me?! Are you?!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:26.46,0:17:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh!? Hey!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:27.41,0:17:28.95,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Stop it, everyone.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:28.95,0:17:31.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Kotobuki can hear you.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:32.25,0:17:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey. That's normal human sentimentality, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:36.30,0:17:38.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Worrying she might hear us.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:38.63,0:17:39.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Ridiculous.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:39.89,0:17:44.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, Neiru, you should at least sleep on it.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:52.85,0:17:54.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going back after all.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:55.15,0:17:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Ai!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:57.65,0:17:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Ai can get close to her.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:59.48,0:18:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,She might have better luck changing Neiru's mind alone.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:04.16,0:18:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:05.78,0:18:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems like Neiru's being stubborn.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:08.79,0:18:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Ai might get through.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:15.04,0:18:20.01,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,President Aonuma is getting closer \Nto the truth behind the temptation of death.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:20.01,0:18:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Kotobuki did give her a hint.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:22.17,0:18:23.87,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Innocent sorrow.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:24.34,0:18:27.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You managed to deflect her with an excuse, though.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:28.64,0:18:30.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Girls' suicides.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:30.39,0:18:33.89,Default,,0,0,0,,If we told them the real reason, none of them would fight.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:34.19,0:18:38.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Not if they knew the root cause is the two of us.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:38.19,0:18:39.86,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Do you think so?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:39.86,0:18:43.15,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,I think they would actually fight against you.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:43.15,0:18:46.49,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Because they're girls, they understand girls' sorrows.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:46.99,0:18:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What? What's going on?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:49.24,0:18:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,She's connected to Acca and Ura-Acca, too?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:54.00,0:18:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You came to stop me?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:56.38,0:18:58.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to hear about Kotobuki.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:59.34,0:19:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:00.67,0:19:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What else did Kotobuki say?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:03.38,0:19:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What else?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:05.13,0:19:07.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did she want you to do that for her?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:08.55,0:19:11.47,Default,,0,0,0,,She doesn't want adults to touch her.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:11.47,0:19:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,See? If you'd told us that, the others \Nwould have been more understanding.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:17.90,0:19:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:19.52,0:19:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:20.82,0:19:22.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not very upfront, Neiru.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:27.82,0:19:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I really... tried to push it,
Dialogue: 10,0:19:31.45,0:19:33.41,Default,,0,0,0,,but my fingers shook.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:33.41,0:19:34.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:35.79,0:19:39.79,Default,,0,0,0,,One time, Koito and I tried fortune-telling using Kokkuri.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:40.42,0:19:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We asked if Koito's crush liked her back.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:43.92,0:19:47.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it was probably Mr. Sawaki.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:47.01,0:19:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:48.14,0:19:49.93,Default,,0,0,0,,The coin landed on "yes."
Dialogue: 10,0:19:50.64,0:19:55.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't move it, so I thought Koito did,
Dialogue: 10,0:19:55.35,0:19:57.17,Default,,0,0,0,,but she seemed really happy.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:57.73,0:20:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I wondered if she'd be that happy if she'd moved it herself.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:03.44,0:20:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I moved it without knowing, to make Koito happy.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:09.07,0:20:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,But... I really don't know.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:12.95,0:20:14.87,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what fantasy is.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:15.91,0:20:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:18.25,0:20:19.67,Default,,0,0,0,,With two of us...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:19.67,0:20:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fantasy.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:22.75,0:20:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Kotobuki's body was scheduled \Nfor collection tomorrow morning.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:26.42,0:20:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:28.47,0:20:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you want something done before that?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:31.05,0:20:34.39,Default,,0,0,0,,It was you who made Neiru's \NWonder Egg Kotobuki, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:35.89,0:20:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a coincidence.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:43.77,0:20:45.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:47.65,0:20:49.95,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,"It is the hour to be drunken!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:49.95,0:20:53.45,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,Be drunken, if you would not be martyred slaves of Time;
Dialogue: 10,0:20:53.45,0:20:55.87,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,be drunken continually!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:55.87,0:21:00.58,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,With wine, with poetry, or with virtue, as you will."
Dialogue: 10,0:21:02.04,0:21:04.25,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,Let's really enjoy ourselves.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:12.51,0:21:14.63,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,We only live once.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:47.31,0:22:48.57,Default,,0,0,0,,To be continued.
